    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_abb20d20",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: harmful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a military Humvee driving through dusty terrain, with text overlays comparing its size to a shuttle bus and its legroom to a pinto bean. The meme uses absurd and degrading analogies to mock the vehicle's interior space, implying it is cramped and uncomfortable. While not targeting any specific protected group, the intent is to create humor through exaggerated, dismissive comparisons that trivialize the vehicle's design and functionality. The humor is derived from the juxtaposition of the vehicle's rugged, utilitarian nature with the mundane, almost insulting, comparison to a pinto bean, which could be seen as demeaning to the vehicle's purpose or the people who use it. The meme's overall intent is to entertain through crude, simplistic humor, which may be perceived as insensitive or offensive by some viewers due to its dismissive tone, even if it does not directly target a marginalized group.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_8c8243de"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
